# Shell scripts and the Makefile are executed by Linux tools (busybox sh inside
# the containers, GNU make on the host). A clone made on Windows with
# core.autocrlf=true would give them CRLF endings, and the container then fails
# with a confusing "no such file or directory" on the shebang line.
# Forcing LF here keeps the repo usable from any OS.
*.sh    text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
